>Extropian?  What about multi-person monogamous relationships (e.g.
>Mormon), many of which are the cultural norm for their geographic or
>demographic areas?

Any type of relationship can be extropian, if it is "rationally
self-determined". What I'm getting at is, "Is it right for you, and is
right for the other person." I have my doubts about the Morman multiple
